    <PROGRAM_DESCRIPTION_LONG>
LifeScheduler is a lightweight, offline-first life scheduling application for Windows and macOS. Built for people who value privacy and simplicity, it runs entirely on your local machine - no cloud sync, no account registration, no recurring fees.

Key Features:
- 100% offline after activation (machine-code bound license)
- Native Qt/C++ performance, minimal resource usage
- Trial mode included (30 days free)
- Portable and installer versions (Windows)
- One-time payment, lifetime access - no subscription
- No telemetry, no data collection

Activation: After installation, the app displays your machine code. Send it to the developer to receive an authorization code. Enter the code once and you're set for life on that device.
    </PROGRAM_DESCRIPTION_LONG>
